DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270325
SUMMARY:Done: W1 4 x 5 min at threshold
DESCRIPTION:2.5 km warm-up\; 4 x (5:00 min at 4:01 to 4:09/km\, HR cap 16
 8\, 1:00 min jog)\; 2.0 km cool-down.\nGo/no-go: under 12h of recovery t
 ime left\, go. 12 to 24h\, the heart-rate cap is absolute. Over 24h\, mo
 ve it a day.\nStrength: Strength\, after the session: heavy lower-body w
 ork. 3 to 4 sets of 3 to 5 reps at a load you could lift about 5 times (
 back or trap-bar squat\, deadlift\, split squat)\, then 3 sets of 5 jump
 s. Heavy and combined strength work improved running performance in a 20
 24 meta-analysis.
END:VEVENT
