UID:strider-2027-05-16-2027-04-28@strider
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270428
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270429
SUMMARY:W6 3 x 3 km at race pace\, the decision session
DESCRIPTION:2.5 km warm-up\; 3 x (3.0 km at 4:01 to 4:06/km\, HR cap 171\
 , 2:30 min jog)\; 2.0 km cool-down.\nGo/no-go: under 12h of recovery tim
 e left\, go. 12 to 24h\, the heart-rate cap is absolute. Over 24h\, move
  it a day.\nDecides the race goal. Run it rested\, in race shoes\, by ef
 fort inside the band\; the heart-rate cap matters more than the fast end
  of the band.\nStrength: Strength\, after the session: keep the load hea
 vy but drop to 2 to 3 sets\, so legs are fresh for race-pace work.\nShoe
 s: Run the decision session in the shoes you intend to race in. Decide t
 oday\, not race week.\nCaffeine: If you will use caffeine on race day\, 
 take the same dose at the same lead time before this session.
END:VEVENT
